{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu","level":"B1","topic":"Infinitivsätze","title":{"de":"Infinitivsätze: ohne … zu","bn":"Infinitive: ohne … zu — না করে"},"summary":"কোনো কাজ না করে: ohne … zu + infinitive।","sections":[{"heading":"ohne … zu — না করে","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Er ging, ohne sich zu verabschieden.","en":"He left without saying goodbye.","bn":"বিদায় না জানিয়েই সে চলে গেল।"},{"de":"Sie ging aus dem Haus, ohne zu frühstücken.","en":"She left the house without having breakfast.","bn":"নাশতা না করেই সে বাসা থেকে বের হলো।"}]}]}],"part":2,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„ohne … zu“ মানে কী?","options":["না করে","করার জন্য","করার পরে"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ohne … zu = না করে।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ging, ohne sich zu ___.","options":["verabschiedet","verabschieden","verabschiedete"],"answer":1,"explanation":"zu + infinitive: zu verabschieden।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er ging, ohne sich zu verabschieden.“ মানে কী?","options":["বিদায় জানিয়ে সে চলে গেল।","বিদায় না জানিয়েই সে চলে গেল।","সে বিদায় জানাতে গেল।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ohne … zu = না করে।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie ging aus dem Haus, ___ zu frühstücken.","options":["um","ohne","statt"],"answer":1,"explanation":"নাশতা না করে → ohne … zu।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"ohne … zu-এর পরে verb কোন রূপে?","options":["zu + Infinitiv","Partizip II","conjugated রূপ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ohne … zu + infinitive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er lernt, ohne Pause zu machen.“ মানে কী?","options":["বিরতি নিয়ে সে পড়ে।","বিরতির পরে সে পড়ে।","বিরতি না নিয়ে সে পড়ে।"],"answer":2,"explanation":"ohne … zu = না করে।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„ohne … zu“ মানে কী?","options":["না করে","করার জন্য","করার পরে"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ohne … zu = না করে।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ging, ohne sich zu ___.","options":["verabschiedet","verabschieden","verabschiedete"],"answer":1,"explanation":"zu + infinitive: zu verabschieden।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er ging, ohne sich zu verabschieden.“ মানে কী?","options":["বিদায় জানিয়ে সে চলে গেল।","বিদায় না জানিয়েই সে চলে গেল।","সে বিদায় জানাতে গেল।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ohne … zu = না করে।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie ging aus dem Haus, ___ zu frühstücken.","options":["um","ohne","statt"],"answer":1,"explanation":"নাশতা না করে → ohne … zu।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"ohne … zu-এর পরে verb কোন রূপে?","options":["zu + Infinitiv","Partizip II","conjugated রূপ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ohne … zu + infinitive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-ohne-zu-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er lernt, ohne Pause zu machen.“ মানে কী?","options":["বিরতি নিয়ে সে পড়ে।","বিরতির পরে সে পড়ে।","বিরতি না নিয়ে সে পড়ে।"],"answer":2,"explanation":"ohne … zu = না করে।"}]}